{"data":[{"author_id":"38335898","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:41:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110908890976063787"],"id":"2110908890976063787","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2076,"like_count":6,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"1917年俄国布尔什维克革命的世界性恶果：\n\n1914年，俄罗斯帝国的总和生育率约为7.4，其出生人口占全球所有出生人口的约8%至12%。\n\n而如今，整个欧洲的总出生人口仅占全球的约4.5%。","url":"https://x.com/ZhangDajun/status/2110908890976063787"},{"author_id":"420093550","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:37:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111285348986958215"],"id":"2111285348986958215","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":218,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111022308332810537","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这段暴跌基本对应了从80-00折期间出生人口的生育率，多数都是独生子女，外加2020年开始的COVID乱象以及经济烂掉，政府依然按照经济上升期模式搜刮民脂民膏。这出生人口跌成这样只是个开始。。。 https://t.co/llBEJPznVy","url":"https://x.com/zach_coredump/status/2111285348986958215"},{"author_id":"1534267089610866688","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:43:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111468217252323777"],"id":"2111468217252323777","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想投胎的时候可以看看全球出生人口排行榜","url":"https://x.com/kim_owo33/status/2111468217252323777"},{"author_id":"2068637413443067904","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:50:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111469834873569542"],"id":"2111469834873569542","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111464689897296241","type":"quoted"}],"text":"第一次世界大战到第二次世界大战中，出生人口增加了6亿\n这说明避孕套的防护性能下降了 https://t.co/sF72nYHhc8","url":"https://x.com/xzyin502/status/2111469834873569542"},{"author_id":"2079947345962389504","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:28:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111434097033871590"],"id":"2111434097033871590","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有个问题\n\n如果社保真的是交社保的养不交社保的这批人\n\n按照目前的出生人口情况，以后我们退休大概率也是拿不到社保的\n\n那么现在交社保还有什么意义吗？","url":"https://x.com/PeterParke5fr3/status/2111434097033871590"},{"author_id":"2024357633285902337","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:00:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111079736747475263"],"id":"2111079736747475263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"国家统计局：2025年出生人口792万，1949年以来最少；同年死亡1131万。每走10个人，只来7个。60岁以上已占23%。今天出生的人数，决定20年后谁来工作、谁来交社保。人口拐点不是预测，已经写进了账本。#人口 #中国经济","url":"https://x.com/pacificowlsome/status/2111079736747475263"},{"author_id":"1860190288557539329","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:43:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110894277522051536"],"id":"2110894277522051536","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":582,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"明年是农历羊年。\n民间传说属羊的人命不好，于是很多夫妇争取把孩子生在今年。\n小区里、公园里，小婴儿的数量眼见着多起来。\n今年出生人口肯定比去年增加不少。\n至于明年，可能又是一个断崖式减少。","url":"https://x.com/ImYanBoss/status/2110894277522051536"},{"author_id":"1549716930378219520","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:49:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111318556826820637"],"id":"2111318556826820637","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":51,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我妈说像我这样不结婚，不生孩子，老了以后在养老院会被护工打。\n\n我大概算了一下现在的出生人口，等我住进养老院的时候，一个护工每天要照顾五六十个老人。\n\n就算他上午打一个，下午打一个，也要一个月才能轮到我。\n\n一个月被打一次，我觉得还总体能接受。万一还是个小姑娘，那就更舒服了。","url":"https://x.com/Veritas135/status/2111318556826820637"},{"author_id":"2062378789502607360","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:16:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110887446212702529"],"id":"2110887446212702529","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":80,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"浙江去年出生人口35万?\n\n一个杭州男生拉了份结婚清单：彩礼、五金、重新装修、酒席烟酒，净掏75万，女方回礼1.2万外加父母背着60万外债。最后婚退了。 \n\n别天天讨论年轻人为什么不爱繁殖了。当婚姻从“两家合伙开公司”变成“单方面资产剥离”，不签合同、立刻止损，是普通人保住现金流最后的理智。","url":"https://x.com/Tigerwps/status/2110887446212702529"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111255781651718144","3_2111255781643374592","3_2111255781584637953","3_2111255781676851201"]},"author_id":"203213759","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:40:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111255900539208145"],"id":"2111255900539208145","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":279,"impression_count":105560,"like_count":745,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":49},"text":"几年前，我曾利用卡介苗批签发量质疑中国官方出生数。有人撰文反驳说，不能用卡介苗批签发量推算出生数。最近，《华尔街日报》专题报道了我的四万多字研究专辑，并引用了我利用卡介苗数据质疑官方出生人口数据的分析。有人又引用那篇文章指责我。我说明一下为什么可用卡介苗数据。 https://t.co/Zao7WuJeRA","url":"https://x.com/fuxianyi/status/2111255900539208145"},{"author_id":"1599631018679742464","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:12:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111248943094898854"],"id":"2111248943094898854","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":335,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111246817501528161","type":"quoted"}],"text":"孩子受教育\n是家庭教育与学校教育\n共同作用\n做人做事的道理\n主要依赖家庭教育\n因材施教，根据每个孩子的特长\n挑选适合孩子的教材和方式\n这是父母的权利，也是责任\n学校教育只能按流水线培养\n不培养，不鼓励，有什么特长\n700万出生人口，1200万大学招生\n缺口500万\n专才，特才\n必然是未来教育发展趋势 https://t.co/NYCk4PcIxy","url":"https://x.com/Hardison0910/status/2111248943094898854"},{"author_id":"1449103717081370630","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:43:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111105858453241920"],"id":"2111105858453241920","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2025年，中国全年出生人口仅792万人创下历史新低，在全球排名中位列第二，仅次于印度2310万。中国看似守住全球第二的位次，实则和尼日利亚、巴基斯坦的差距已经微乎其微，之前总觉得中国人口多是常态，现在看到新生儿占比跌到6%，人口负增长与少子老龄化加速的严峻现实，才意识到人口结构的变化真的离","url":"https://x.com/Rishav2924/status/2111105858453241920"},{"author_id":"1722347682830635008","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:29:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111494934276538428"],"id":"2111494934276538428","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":101,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111442130036002953","type":"quoted"}],"text":"华尔街日报日文网的文章水平真是不敢恭维。首先，易富贤的人口估计值是一个模型计算结果，用一个模型预测值去否定实际人口统计值，违背基本的科学原则，需要重大而确凿的证据证明中国的人口统计数据出现重大差错。而这一点，易富贤没有证明，也几乎没有任何人或机构提供了可靠的证明。其次，即便以易富 https://t.co/SUxUFaPG0p","url":"https://x.com/kongdingji/status/2111494934276538428"},{"author_id":"2098773821973291008","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:44:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111075725885526458"],"id":"2111075725885526458","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":4273,"like_count":77,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":10},"text":"基本盘思维汇总\n中国经济差 → 都是美国打压，说明中国太强了\n中国经济好 → 东升西降，制度优势\n中国技术突破 → 遥遥领先，西方急了\n中国技术失败 → 西方封锁太坏了\n中国社会稳定 → 中国人最幸福，西方羡慕\n中国出现动荡 → 境外势力颜色革命\n外国经济差 → 资本主义走到末路\n外国经济好 →","url":"https://x.com/Peter90116/status/2111075725885526458"},{"author_id":"1897387881460850689","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:34:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110922392457322739"],"id":"2110922392457322739","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":589,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🔥【让人破防】中共国与欧美日台发达国家将永远保持落后80-100年以上的水平。不喜勿喷！\n\n中国当然还会进步，但进步不等于能追上日本？经济总量大不等于全面领先欧美日？别自欺欺人了！\n📉 2025年，中国出生人口仅792万，死亡人口1131万，一年净减少339万！\n🔬","url":"https://x.com/deutschw989/status/2110922392457322739"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111323066550845440"]},"author_id":"1486571626661437440","created_at":"2026-10-17T05:08:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111323366519165383"],"id":"2111323366519165383","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":5065,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110605937186939099","type":"quoted"}],"text":"中国的人口变局 👶🏻👴🏻\n\n1949 年之后，中国有过三波婴儿潮，每一波婴儿长大成人，都要吃饭穿衣和就业。\n\n第一波在建国后的头十年。\n\n这拨人成年时，城市吸纳不了这么多年轻人，文革又停了高考和招工，最后靠上山下乡，把城市的就业压力转移到了农村。\n\n第二波从 60 年代初到 70 年代中期，出生规模最大。 https://t.co/9RpmscS4OT https://t.co/4sz0hlkaJr","url":"https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2111323366519165383"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111468861119750144"]},"author_id":"1901353962579845120","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:46:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111468869491552492"],"id":"2111468869491552492","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":2795,"like_count":77,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1969753037859144043","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Fertility Rate map of Finland in 2025 by Region, between 2024 &amp; 2025 the Finnish TFR rose from 1.252 to 1.305.\nhttps://t.co/eamyHJ39wp https://t.co/CRReI2v4zV","url":"https://x.com/WDemograph73569/status/2111468869491552492"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111270258019573760"]},"author_id":"1492092029609799680","created_at":"2026-10-17T10:45:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111408275489227175"],"id":"2111408275489227175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1444,"like_count":39,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":14},"text":"Let’s have a look at the data behind Australia’s fertility crisis, because the data sends a deeply chilling message:\n\nImmigration is LOWERING the fertility rate and heavily loading the middle aged and older working aged population whilst abandoning our own youth. \n\nIt’s also","url":"https://x.com/QBCCIntegrity/status/2111408275489227175"},{"author_id":"1291788077405540352","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:45:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111257255416906028"],"id":"2111257255416906028","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1545,"like_count":63,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110626305779609848","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Ethnic Malays significantly below replacement fertility in Malaysia.  Malay TFR in Singapore gives us a window as to how far it could fall in Malaysia in the near to medium term.  So far that number looks like ~1.5. https://t.co/yvTgkISpD3","url":"https://x.com/Aaronal16/status/2111257255416906028"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111066468410597378"]},"author_id":"1041044330092195840","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:10:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111067200564162942"],"id":"2111067200564162942","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":5497,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Chart of TFR  versus when countries crossed the $5K and $10K GDP thresholds.\n\nIn 1950, a country at $10K had over 4 children per woman. By 2020, it was around 2.\n\nSo it's not just wealth. Fertility is getting worse with time. I try to explain why. https://t.co/uyGRCpXqc0 https://t.co/36mce5vXFV","url":"https://x.com/RichardHanania/status/2111067200564162942"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110919012670676992"]},"author_id":"1408623938012254215","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:21:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110919113925378435"],"id":"2110919113925378435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4595,"like_count":174,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":130},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1662650442806091776","type":"quoted"}],"text":"#สิทธิลาคลอด 180 วัน \n\nประเด็นที่หลายคนพูดถึง จากการขับเคลื่อนจากภาคประชาสังคม ให้เพิ่มจากเดิม 120 วัน ตรงกับนโยบายรัฐสวัสดิการในกฎหมายแรงงานของ #พรรคก้าวไกล ช่วงหาเสียงเลือกตั้งเมื่อปี 2566 ถูกกลับมาพูดถึงอีกครั้ง\n\nอาจารย์จั๊ก หยิบยกเรื่องนี้มาพูด https://t.co/llQ9d87Lo4 https://t.co/3bQQjBpAru","url":"https://x.com/tootsyreview/status/2110919113925378435"},{"author_id":"1770466124418744320","created_at":"2026-10-16T07:43:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110999948430872781"],"id":"2110999948430872781","in_reply_to_user_id":"1881115794005782531","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":46,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@CatoThistlewood @PositivFuturist @RealBlackIrish\n\nHelp me out here guys.\n\nI'm running some numbers and I must have got something wrong here.\n\nPopulation change excluding immigration, 1967–2026\n1967–1997\nStarting population (1967): 55.0 million\nNatural increase (births minus","url":"https://x.com/AngloLombard/status/2110999948430872781"},{"author_id":"20125143","created_at":"2026-10-16T07:15:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110993085190787489"],"id":"2110993085190787489","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":91,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"🧐How does the high birth rate in ultra-Orthodox families benefit Israel demographically, economically, and strategically?👇🏻\n\nWhile the high birth rate among Orthodox and Ultra-Orthodox (Haredi) families presents economic challenges regarding state integration and public","url":"https://x.com/irusman/status/2110993085190787489"},{"author_id":"1416096805822025731","created_at":"2026-10-16T21:57:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111214893185565178"],"id":"2111214893185565178","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":361,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Israeli births have surged in 2026, anomalously defying the otherwise shared global fertility crisis suffered across the entire developed world, especially the great western nations.\n\nIsrael is the only developed country that has above replacement fertility. \n\nJudaism is actually","url":"https://x.com/JakeFitzsimons_/status/2111214893185565178"},{"article":{"title":"🔥中国到这时剩3.2亿人？美国权威算出来了‼️ "},"author_id":"3341502893","created_at":"2026-10-16T20:59:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111200345992974349"],"id":"2111200345992974349","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4083,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"https://t.co/jwy47cm5at","url":"https://x.com/zhihui999/status/2111200345992974349"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2111255781651718144","type":"photo"},{"med